Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.45,0:00:01.30,Alt,,0,0,0,,Hadi aşkım.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.55,0:00:02.60,Alt,,0,0,0,,Toplantın var.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.65,0:00:07.60,Alt,,0,0,0,,Sayın Muhtar…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.25,0:00:11.90,Alt,,0,0,0,,Rıza ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:14.00,Alt,,0,0,0,,Yeni ortağınız.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.50,0:00:16.60,Alt,,0,0,0,,Şalteri kapatıyoruz, tasarrufu paylaşıyoruz.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.70,0:00:17.85,Alt,,0,0,0,,Kazan kazan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.18,0:00:20.98,Alt,,0,0,0,,Öncekiler slayt getirmişti.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.73,0:00:25.88,Alt,,0,0,0,,Bakın, fatura burada.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.28,0:00:27.63,Alt,,0,0,0,,Üç yüz otuz üç bin—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.76,0:00:34.26,Alt,,0,0,0,,Koş Rıza, koş!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.31,0:00:36.26,Alt,,0,0,0,,Yetişemez.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.06,0:00:39.16,Alt,,0,0,0,,Sayın Muhtar!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:40.66,Alt,,0,0,0,,Muhtar Bey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.06,0:00:42.06,Alt,,0,0,0,,Bir dakika!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.71,0:00:45.51,Alt,,0,0,0,,Ver bakayım.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.86,0:00:48.71,Alt,,0,0,0,,Sen kimsin?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.81,0:00:50.31,Alt,,0,0,0,,Yeni…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.76,0:00:51.56,Alt,,0,0,0,,sahip…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.16,0:00:53.01,Alt,,0,0,0,,Sahip mi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.66,0:00:56.91,Alt,,0,0,0,,Şalter Muhtar'da.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:00:58.21,Alt,,0,0,0,,Muhtar bende.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.56,0:00:59.66,Alt,,0,0,0,,Anahtar da burada.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.36,0:01:01.21,Alt,,0,0,0,,Verir misiniz?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.81,0:01:03.46,Alt,,0,0,0,,Veririm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.91,0:01:04.66,Alt,,0,0,0,,Bir şartla.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.71,0:01:09.16,KutuKoyu,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1290)\frz2\fscx70\fscy70\t(0,140,\fscx106\fscy106)\t(140,220,\fscx100\fscy100)}EMİNE'NİN ŞARTI NE?
